      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "A58E6D02325D599F",
      "text": "Monsieur Hassa... !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "7FA3DF75249E9431",
      "text": "Les émotions ont bien failli me submerger...\\nmais j’ai su les maîtriser.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "7FA3E075249E95E4",
      "text": "Après tout, il serait fâcheux que j’effraie\\nvos camarades de l’institut.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "ABAAE67B8608A4C7",
      "text": "Cette opportunité d’enseigner dans un autre\\nétablissement me réjouit au plus haut point ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "ABAAE57B8608A314",
      "text": "Mais à ce propos... Ai-je été sollicité en tant\\nque professeur d’art ou en tant que membre\\r\\ndu Conseil 4 ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "FAA7DBE6492B3173",
      "text": "En tant que professeur d’art !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "FAA7DCE6492B3326",
      "text": "En tant que membre du Conseil 4 !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "ABAAE87B8608A82D",
      "text": "Vous m’en voyez ravi. Il me semblait pourtant\\nque mon dernier cours d’art n’avait pas remporté\\r\\nun franc succès auprès des élèves...\\c\\nCependant, peut-être me suis-je fourvoyé...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "BC1158E4C0B5FE3D",
      "text": "Oui, je le pressentais !\\c\\nEn effet, mon dernier cours d’art n’avait pas\\nremporté un franc succès auprès des élèves...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "ABAAE77B8608A67A",
      "text": "Par ailleurs, il me semble avoir entendu dire que\\nl’Institut Myrtille s’investissait particulièrement\\r\\ndans les combats Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "ABAAE27B86089DFB",
      "text": "Une séance de travaux pratiques avec l’aide\\nde monsieur Griknot me semble tout indiquée !\\c\\nMerci beaucoup pour vos conseils avisés ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "035710832287CAF6",
      "text": "Il semblerait que les élèves de l’Institut Myrtille\\ns’impliquent volontairement et activement\\r\\ndans la vie de l’école, voire dans diverses\\r\\ntâches administratives.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "035711832287CCA9",
      "text": "Quoi de plus idoine pour un établissement aussi\\nnovateur que d’expérimenter, après tout ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "03570E832287C790",
      "text": "Ceci étant dit, à titre personnel, je m’interroge\\nsur le bien-fondé de ce fonctionnement, qui\\r\\nimplique de faire endosser à de jeunes élèves\\r\\nde lourdes responsabilités...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 175,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "8AFE44BFB460A738",
      "text": "Ah oui ? Pourquoi ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "8AFE47BFB460AC51",
      "text": "Que voulez-vous dire ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "03570F832287C943",
      "text": "En un mot comme en cent, c’est le privilège\\nde l’enfance de pouvoir s’abandonner\\r\\nà l’insouciance et à l’amusement.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "035714832287D1C2",
      "text": "Et c’est précisément pour cela que\\nje m’inquiète également pour vous.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "FBEC39A0F7DADC90",
      "text": "Faites attention à ne pas vous surmener dans\\nle but de répondre aux attentes d’autrui.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "FBEC3AA0F7DADE43",
      "text": "Veuillez m’excuser... L’âge avançant, j’ai une\\nlégère tendance à vouloir donner des leçons.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "FBEC3BA0F7DADFF6",
      "text": "Changeons plutôt de sujet, voulez-vous ?\\nSeriez-vous intéressé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e par un échange Pokémon ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "FBEC3CA0F7DAE1A9",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Merci d’avoir accepté ma proposition.\\nJe souhaite vous confier un Cryodo exceptionnel.\\c\\nEt vous, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], quel Pokémon\\nallez-vous\\r\\nme confier ?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
